s passes, doesn't head, and contact plays are completely out. With him on the roster, Fujimi High School is to play against the historically strong Oshigamiminami High School. That's where Aoyama-kun meets another U-16 national player, the forward Takechi, again. Aoyama-kun has the absolute territory called germaphobia. What will happen in this match?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bZYaadf5lYXu0FrzJxJTMTvXBCf.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"The prodigy U-16 national player Aoyama-kun has come Fujimi High School's weak soccer team! However, he's an extreme clean freak! He avoids passes, doesn't head, and contact plays are completely out. With him on the roster, Fujimi High School is to play against the historically strong Oshigamiminami High School. That's where Aoyama-kun meets another U-16 national player, the forward Takechi, again. Aoyama-kun has the absolute territory called germaphobia. What will happen in this match?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bZYaadf5lYXu0FrzJxJTMTvXBCf.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12762","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98205","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34825","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72507","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"328823","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"35724","synopsis":"Since Aoyama-kun joined the soccer club, from one day to another, the dirty club house has become spotless! On top of that, the school uniforms are neatly folded! But it's not Aoyama-kun's doing!? Is this the work of a fairy!? Meanwhile, the rumor that Aoyama-kun's towel smell amazing wildly escalates. \"I want to smell it!\" \"But my pride!\" \"I need to protect Aoyama-kun!\" These thoughts, amongst others, collide!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9ZoqqvJJdhV1LJ9xIAD9YLOwQiS.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Since Aoyama-kun joined the soccer club, from one day to another, the dirty club house has become spotless! On top of that, the school uniforms are neatly folded! But it's not Aoyama-kun's doing!? Is this the work of a fairy!? Meanwhile, the rumor that Aoyama-kun's towel smell amazing wildly escalates. \"I want to smell it!\" \"But my pride!\" \"I need to protect Aoyama-kun!\" These thoughts, amongst others, collide!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9ZoqqvJJdhV1LJ9xIAD9YLOwQiS.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12762","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98205","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34825","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72507","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"328823","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"35729","synopsis":"The day before the match, people from the soccer team are getting food at a family restaurant. Suddenly, Takechi appears and starts an eating costest with Yoshioka. Then, the day of the match vs Takada Academy. The match is about to begin, but Aoyama-kun can't be found anywhere! Left without a choice, Fujimi High School starts the match without Aoyama-kun. Could this be their biggest challenge in the preliminaries?!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cyeYqxB2TCpiTfuQvkaoH57IGYi.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"The day before the match, people from the soccer team are getting food at a family restaurant. Suddenly, Takechi appears and starts an eating costest with Yoshioka. Then, the day of the match vs Takada Academy. The match is about to begin,